Files placed in this directory are copied verbatim into the built site.

Use it for anything the build does not generate:

  CNAME          a custom domain for GitHub Pages, e.g. modelmap.example.com
  _redirects     Cloudflare Pages redirect rules
  og-image.png   a social preview image, if you add one

This placeholder file is harmless if it ships. Delete it once you put something
real in here.
